computed-style getters more robust.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334712\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334721\n", "files": ["layout/style/nsComputedDOMStyle.cpp"], "git_node": "2eab3333d19d74028c5e6d7fd6ccd2d25f73e5ad", "git_parents": ["eccb77415c83db202ad6215a71cba803d9d261c2"], "node": "4ed852e68ab33b2c82bc3384edfe06c857f2ce37", "parents": ["83e6238cd869d707ab0bb31b50760a91ea03e074"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792271664, "git_changesets": ["2eab3333d19d74028c5e6d7fd6ccd2d25f73e5ad"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1723": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068410 - Update the initialized length before the length in ArraySetLength.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334008\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334517\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/Array.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/arrays/set-length-oom.js"], "git_node": "a549320b47c94a2c91c66bdd9a9d005b2491fdd8", "git_parents": ["2eab3333d19d74028c5e6d7fd6ccd2d25f73e5ad"], "node": "005baad524fb84e33d34671c0ac084cbc02a6d57", "parents": ["4ed852e68ab33b2c82bc3384edfe06c857f2ce37"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792271687, "git_changesets": ["a549320b47c94a2c91c66bdd9a9d005b2491fdd8"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1724": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079255.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334059\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334973\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsBlockFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-multicol/crashtests/block-break-before.html"], "git_node": "107e89145dee3585970398ca1d306141e63f2045", "git_parents": ["a549320b47c94a2c91c66bdd9a9d005b2491fdd8"], "node": "847cd3e4ff56af0a153074c4155881778f4e66e2", "parents": ["005baad524fb84e33d34671c0ac084cbc02a6d57"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792348929, "git_changesets": ["107e89145dee3585970398ca1d306141e63f2045"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1725": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082064.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nThe crashtest only crashes on ASAN builds but works.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334529\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334972\n", "files": ["layout/generic/MiddleCroppingBlockFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/rendering/widgets/file-type-label-update-crash.https.html"], "git_node": "946afed6086a564a9e59a496e75ca75872f2b8b2", "git_parents": ["107e89145dee3585970398ca1d306141e63f2045"], "node": "4ab25b42897bf1d68b64122a84738417a5a0e035", "parents": ["847cd3e4ff56af0a153074c4155881778f4e66e2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792348954, "git_changesets": ["946afed6086a564a9e59a496e75ca75872f2b8b2"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1726": {"changesets": [{"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "[ESR 115] Bug 2071733 - Update FFmpeg decoded frame plane handling.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334909\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoDecoder.cpp", "dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoUtils.h"], "git_node": "d67301de44aa897a87e920d683a82a84e61b9f38", "git_parents": ["946afed6086a564a9e59a496e75ca75872f2b8b2"], "node": "b5cbe0afcaf01dba4f4e8c0e5fb4280de00aea2c", "parents": ["4ab25b42897bf1d68b64122a84738417a5a0e035"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792348979, "git_changesets": ["d67301de44aa897a87e920d683a82a84e61b9f38"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1727": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081977 - Deal better with style changes in replicated subtrees.   a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nQuite a massive hammer, but simple and should be correct / fix a lot of\nthese issues at once.\n\nWe'd need to reframe the root for replicated fixed pos, and would need to\nreframe at least the replicated table for the replicated rowgroups.\n\nHowever since nsPageSequenceFrame will bail on incremental reflow\n(bug 1152354), well...\n\nOther bugs that I found while at this are that nsTableCellMap::Synchronize\nand nsTableFrame::ResetRowIndices only look at a single table continuation.\nA dynamic row-group removal leaks a cell map.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334564\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334970\n", "files": ["layout/base/RestyleManager.cpp", "layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/printing/fixed-container-query-removal-crash-print.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/printing/table-row-group-container-query-crash-print.html"], "git_node": "eac2a79d3e3f3761e6315694f68b8bbe302fb33c", "git_parents": ["d67301de44aa897a87e920d683a82a84e61b9f38"], "node": "c7c40f9919b0da39f2ae4f07f7194df17aafb9ae", "parents": ["b5cbe0afcaf01dba4f4e8c0e5fb4280de00aea2c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081977 - Share generated content pseudo-elements and skip counters for extra frames.   a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nRepeated table headers and replicated fixed-pos frames used to create\nnew pseudo-element containers and counter nodes for each copy, which\nconfused the generated content lists.\n\nReuse the original pseudo-element instead, and don't make extra frames\nparticipate in counters.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334565\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334971\n", "files": ["layout/base/crashtests/crashtests.list", "layout/base/crashtests/repeated-counter-marker.html", "layout/base/crashtests/repeated-counter-marker.sjs", "layout/base/crashtests/repeated-generated-content.html", "layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.h"], "git_node": "5d6d36feee198515ce6d0dca749806b5569851d3", "git_parents": ["eac2a79d3e3f3761e6315694f68b8bbe302fb33c"], "node": "f29e15b56e1f8f9e10f28569ade39946aac6b652", "parents": ["c7c40f9919b0da39f2ae4f07f7194df17aafb9ae"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792349004, "git_changesets": ["eac2a79d3e3f3761e6315694f68b8bbe302fb33c", "5d6d36feee198515ce6d0dca749806b5569851d3"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1728": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082009 - Don't lose NS_FRAME_GENERATED_CONTENT bit when replicating headers/fixed frames.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334609\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334902\n", "files": ["layout/base/nsCSSFrameConstructor.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/printing/fixed-generated-content-whitespace-crash-print.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/printing/repeated-generated-content-whitespace-crash-print.html"], "git_node": "72b9c7acbfcd0697eea20cbde2f8176cde335023", "git_parents": ["5d6d36feee198515ce6d0dca749806b5569851d3"], "node": "4cbafbc8416d067df6adb9e2a9e35b3d0ba25ddf", "parents": ["f29e15b56e1f8f9e10f28569ade39946aac6b652"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792349029, "git_changesets": ["72b9c7acbfcd0697eea20cbde2f8176cde335023"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1729": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082762 - Cache component bounds to avoid exponential work traversing COLRv1 paint graph.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334765\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334934\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/COLRFonts.cpp"], "git_node": "6fb500756e25005bf27886d9bc5152cfa26f7683", "git_parents": ["72b9c7acbfcd0697eea20cbde2f8176cde335023"], "node": "ba5c3b85064ed1b85a562af7e147d9f00fe88c3c", "parents": ["4cbafbc8416d067df6adb9e2a9e35b3d0ba25ddf"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792349052, "git_changesets": ["6fb500756e25005bf27886d9bc5152cfa26f7683"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1730": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082064 - Remove unused mCropped. a=bustage\n", "files": ["layout/generic/MiddleCroppingBlockFrame.cpp"], "git_node": "11d06b35a2be819649358777e16d8d228b967233", "git_parents": ["6fb500756e25005bf27886d9bc5152cfa26f7683"], "node": "64d0fca731cf83610df6f8542deeb69bc9dedf61", "parents": ["ba5c3b85064ed1b85a562af7e147d9f00fe88c3c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792351847, "git_changesets": ["11d06b35a2be819649358777e16d8d228b967233"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1731": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2082064 - Remove the right class from crashtest. a=bustage\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/tests/html/rendering/widgets/file-type-label-update-crash.https.html"], "git_node": "7dd2524a41dda39666c46e7779b1942fa3f8783e", "git_parents": ["11d06b35a2be819649358777e16d8d228b967233"], "node": "7e4c497be55d686e7ae3a27139b4809a966eba63", "parents": ["64d0fca731cf83610df6f8542deeb69bc9dedf61"], "tags": []}], "date": 1792355899, "git_changesets": ["7dd2524a41dda39666c46e7779b1942fa3f8783e"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "1732": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080271 - Make sure that we paint after .ready in fontface-descriptor-updates. a=test-only\n\nSeems the screenshot without this captures the blank paint.\n\nThis works locally but checking 